## Room Aggregation & Head-to-Head Math
- **Member Total Score** = $\sum_{c \in \text{Categories}} \min(\text{Raw Points}_c, \text{Cap}_c)$.
- **Room 154 Total** = $\text{Score}_{\text{Pranjay}} + \text{Score}_{\text{Abhishek}} + \text{Score}_{\text{Prakrit}}$.
- **Room 264 Total** = $\text{Score}_{\text{Salil}} + \text{Score}_{\text{Yajas}} + \text{Score}_{\text{Gopal}}$.
- **Room 154 Average** = $\text{Room 154 Total} \div 3.0$.
- **Room 264 Average** = $\text{Room 264 Total} \div 3.0$.
- **Margin / Delta** = $\text{Room 154 Average} - \text{Room 264 Average}$.

